 "remarks": "2 bedroom, 2 bath unit on 2nd floor with million dollar water views of Stamford Harbor and beyond. Live like you are on vacation year 'round in this one level condo featuring an open floor plan with 9' ceilings and hickory floors. The eat-in kitchen with high end appliances, wood cabinetry and granite counters is open to the spacious living room with gas fireplace and stunning water views. The master bedroom is on the water side with a master bath that features marble and double vanities. Guest bedroom features a marble bathroom in the hall. Harbor Point with restaurants galore is just a water taxi away. Private terrace overlooking the harbor is the perfect spot to start and end your day. 40' Boat slip avail at additional cost. 2 parking spaces in garage.",
